sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend
    participant Server
    participant Database
    
    Admin->>Frontend: Buka halaman Master Template
    Admin->>Frontend: Input nama kategori & deskripsi
    Frontend->>Server: POST /api/templates
    Server->>Database: INSERT INTO master_templates
    Database-->>Server: Return ID
    Server-->>Frontend: Success
    
    Admin->>Frontend: Buat Workflow Definition
    Admin->>Frontend: Tambah Workflow Steps (urutan, role_id, tipe: UPLOAD/APPROVE/REVIEW)
    Frontend->>Server: POST /api/workflows
    Server->>Database: INSERT INTO workflow_definitions & workflow_steps
    Database-->>Server: Success
    Server-->>Frontend: Workflow Aktif
